6. This repo's code for the Q4_0 rule against llama.cpp's Q4_0 file
   blk.12.ffn_up.weight: equal on 95.96 % of entries, largest difference 3.0e-04 of the largest weight
   blk.12.attn_output.weight: equal on 95.64 % of entries, largest difference 3.9e-04 of the largest weight
   blk.30.ffn_down.weight: equal on 95.42 % of entries, largest difference 1.8e-04 of the largest weight
   The differences are of the size of one step of a 16-bit float: llama.cpp stores the scale as a 16-bit float and
   multiplies, this code multiplies and then stores the product as a 16-bit float.

